' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Op.Think, Mod.Result, Op.Wait, Op.Exit
' @description Minimal THINK with one RESULT field

THINK verdict
  GOAL <<
  Classify the request.
  >>
  RESULT
  * category: CHOICE(bug, feature, question) - request type
END

WAIT
  ON ?verdict
END

EXIT
